Package: evolution-data-server
Version: @DEB_EDS_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: System
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/evolution-data-server
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libical3, libsoup-3.0-0, libsecret-1-0, libjson-glib-1.0-0, libsqlite3-1, libxml2, libicu74, libiconv, dbus
Description: evolution database backend server
 Calendar, task and addressbook backend for GNOME: the client libraries
 (libedataserver, libecal, libebook) plus the D-Bus source registry and
 calendar/addressbook factories. Built for the Xios desktop so gnome-shell's
 calendar works; SMIME, Kerberos, LDAP, weather calendars, online accounts
 and the GTK prompt UIs are disabled in this build. Run glib-compile-schemas
 once after install (standard Xios desktop step).
